{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3803260/extras/47f33045faf8929dbf3f89007ca9c89e.avif?t=1759266605\" width=420 height=145 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>Scrapbook</i> is an indie game about slowing down, exploring at your own pace, and turning little moments into lasting memories.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">\ud83d\udcf7 \u22c6\uff61\u00b0\u2729\uff61\u22c6 \ud83c\udf43 \u22c6\uff61\u00b0\u2729\uff61\u22c6 \ud83d\udcd4 \u22c6\uff61\u00b0\u2729\uff61\u22c6 \ud83d\udcf7 \u22c6\uff61\u00b0\u2729\uff61\u22c6 \ud83c\udf43 \u22c6\uff61\u00b0\u2729\uff61\u22c6 \ud83d\udcd4</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Pack up your camper van and set out on a laid-back journey through quiet forests, sandy beaches, and hidden paths. Along the way you\u2019ll find places worth exploring, breathtaking views to photograph and trinkets to be kept.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3803260/extras/da2d2ec94bf928069eba9a5e93bb5aeb.avif?t=1759266605\" data-has-big width=1560 height=878 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >With your camera in hand, snap photos of the places that catch your heart. Then open your scrapbook and make them your own by arranging pictures, tucking in keepsakes, jotting down notes, and decorating the pages to your liking.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">\ud83d\udcf7 \u22c6\uff61\u00b0\u2729\uff61\u22c6 \ud83c\udf43 \u22c6\uff61\u00b0\u2729\uff61\u22c6 \ud83d\udcd4 \u22c6\uff61\u00b0\u2729\uff61\u22c6 \ud83d\udcf7 \u22c6\uff61\u00b0\u2729\uff61\u22c6 \ud83c\udf43 \u22c6\uff61\u00b0\u2729\uff61\u22c6 \ud83d\udcd4</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Bit by bit, your scrapbook grows into a beautiful, memory filled treasure to keep, cherish and always come back to when you need the reminder to take a deep breath and just..be right here in this very moment, enjoying your surroundings.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3803260/extras/9a85f692eb0db7fcee582b0f05c6e8fe.avif?t=1759266605\" data-has-big width=1560 height=878 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">\ud83d\udcf7 \u22c6\uff61\u00b0\u2729\uff61\u22c6 \ud83c\udf43 \u22c6\uff61\u00b0\u2729\uff61\u22c6 \ud83d\udcd4 \u22c6\uff61\u00b0\u2729\uff61\u22c6 \ud83d\udcf7 \u22c6\uff61\u00b0\u2729\uff61\u22c6 \ud83c\udf43 \u22c6\uff61\u00b0\u2729\uff61\u22c6 \ud83d\udcd4</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3803260?t=1759266605","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3803260?t=1759266605","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3803260/1f2f4c43bc8fa3ea00d2123849e0a6712f4d7218/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1759266605","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3803260/1f2f4c43bc8fa3ea00d2123849e0a6712f4d7218/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1759266605","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Steam Achievements","id":22},{"description":"Full controller support","id":28},{"description":"Camera Comfort","id":67},{"description":"Custom Volume Controls","id":68},{"description":"Playable without Timed Input","id":74},{"description":"Save Anytime","id":79},{"description":"Stereo Sound","id":69},{"description":"Surround Sound","id":70},{"description":"Steam Cloud","id":23},{"description":"Family 